# A complaint and an apology in Russian: жалоба, извините
subtitle: "Complain politely, apologise and ask to be forgiven in Russian: жа́ловаться на, извини́ться пе́ред … за, прости́те нас, and the words of a written apology."
tags: ["russian","complaint in russian","apology in russian","извиниться","russian phrases"]
teaches: ["phrases/complaints-apologies","phrases/formal-register","grammar/verb-cases"]
thumb: "band \"Apologise in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Hardly and almost in Russian: вряд ли, едва, чуть не","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/183-russian-hardly.cast"}

