      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:r6qhsm'
    '|a||Мне принесли́ горя́чий суп и десе́рт.':
